WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,920
It tastes very sweet too. Eat more.

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:03,720
When you are full, you will have the strength to kill the hounds.

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:07,130
I don’t know how many hounds I have to kill to get the key.

4
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,450
Is the news accurate?

5
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:10,410
I've killed fifty hounds

6
00:00:10,410 --> 00:00:11,610
No keys have been dropped yet

7
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,210
Is it possible to kill a hundred of them?

8
00:00:13,210 --> 00:00:14,210
Or two hundred

9
00:00:15,780 --> 00:00:18,500
I don’t know how the other two groups are doing, big brother.

10
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:19,980
We've got the key

11
00:00:21,060 --> 00:00:22,100
Why are you so fast?

12
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:23,910
I'm not sure either

13
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:25,710
It seems to be based on chance.

14
00:00:25,830 --> 00:00:28,430
But what does this key say?

15
00:00:28,970 --> 00:00:30,930
All survivors who choose to enter the church

16
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:34,010
It's either life or death. It's either death or life.

17
00:00:34,410 --> 00:00:36,370
Unable to escape by any other means

18
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:39,730
In other words, anyone who chooses to enter the church must pass the customs

19
00:00:39,730 --> 00:00:44,930
Otherwise, it's a dead end. Okay, I got it. Thanks. I'll contact you when I report the key.
